        "original_id": "124a30e5-ba75-58a9-ab08-289d9d31a2bd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert L. Stone\n- Companies: The Hertz Corporation, Columbia Pictures\n- Roles: Chief executive officer, television division leader\n- Topics: Car rental industry, global operations\n\nFacts:\n- Robert L. Stone was born on December 19, 1921.\n- Robert L. Stone was an American business executive.\n- Robert L. Stone ran the television division at Columbia Pictures.\n- Robert L. Stone served as chief executive officer of The Hertz Corporation.\n- The Hertz Corporation is the second-largest US car rental company by sales, locations, and fleet size.\n- The Hertz Corporation operates in 150 countries across North America, Europe, Latin America, Africa, Asia, Australia, the Caribbean, the Middle East, and New Zealand.\n- Robert L. Stone died on January 28, 2009.",
